    "body": "The C++ Core Guidelines recommend **establishing an error handling strategy early in a project's design** ([E.1](https://isocpp.github.io/CppCoreGuidelines/CppCoreGuidelines#re-design)). Under the presumption that \"we are still early\" and given the fact that there is lots of development (eg #34931, #35003, #34132, ...) without such a strategy, it might be the right time to come up with a design document.\r\n\r\nI post this as a PR rather than an Issue, because it will simplify giving feedback on individual parts of the text.",
